{"agent":"bg99","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"`_branch_ahead` documents a return of -1 when the branch cannot be counted and says that value must never be folded into \"empty\", but `_gone_tree` only special-cases `ahead > 0`. Any other result, including -1 (empty `rec.branch`, or `G.commits_ahead` failing), falls through to `rec.advice = \"worktree is gone; nothing to salvage\"` and leaves `salvageable` unset. Given a missing worktree whose branch still exists but `commits_ahead` returns -1, recover tells the operator there is nothing to salvage — the same false empty verdict as B5b1c6272c1 — instead of leaving the row unmeasured the way the budget path sets `salvageable = None`.","digest":"ac1f0ff0e2f9e7ea","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/services/leases/recovery.py:_gone_tree","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/leases/recovery.py:_gone_tree"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":5629,"diff_sha":"313579023f8255a38b80223ab22d8ef96c5aae77200a5f8f6048e46f5a735660","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-B5b1c6272c1","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":17.1,"family":"xai","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"3f740f8f23c8cc6a","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B5b1c6272c1.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261108T221755Z-94212255.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"d427a91b113c5ef915b151ab0404192bfed2cc5d","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/services/leases/recovery.py":"100644 63d997493b80b4db4d46e3aa9eaf50f3f73f207d","tests/test_recover_merged_item.py":"100644 5e77a692cd4b47926e73404fbdbb2686f4add341"},"reviewer":"grok-4.7","reviewer_digest":"1857ec352c55ee94","reviewer_families":["xai"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/services/leases/recovery.py:_gone_tree"],"tr